# --- generated agent artifacts (recreated by `pixi run setup`) ---
CLAUDE.md
.claude/skills
.codex/skills

# --- datasets (root-anchored so src/<pkg>/data/ package data is NOT ignored) ---
/data

# --- large / ephemeral media (figures/ ITSELF is committed -- they're deliverables) ---
# Videos and frame dumps (e.g. animation frames) are large and regenerable: keep them out.
# Route throwaway frame sequences into a `frames/` subdir; drop a video in and it's ignored.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
**/frames/

# --- pixi ---
.pixi/

